SafeDecide 140M FP32 model

The SafeDecide model card declares Apache-2.0 for the fine-tuned checkpoint:
https://huggingface.co/yotambr/safedecide-140m/tree/1934a00e6ba5242668c3f1b06fa39fb438741207

The checkpoint identifies jhu-clsp/mmBERT-small as its base model. Its model
card declares MIT:
https://huggingface.co/jhu-clsp/mmBERT-small

Model files are downloaded and verified by the consumer at runtime. They are
not included in this package. Review the pinned model cards and licenses before
hosting or redistributing model assets.
